 "captions": [
  {
   "t0": 0.525,
   "t1": 3.52,
   "text": "Tonight, the Moon starts coming closer.",
   "line": "L1",
   "spoken": "Tonight, the Moon starts coming closer."
  },
  {
   "t0": 3.625,
   "t1": 5.92,
   "text": "And it never stops.",
   "line": "L1",
   "spoken": "And it never stops."
  },
  {
   "t0": 6.3,
   "t1": 14.185,
   "text": "Right now it's about 239,000 miles away, drifting off an inch and a half a year.",
   "line": "L2",
   "spoken": "Right now it's about two hundred thirty-nine thousand miles away, drifting off an inch and a half a year."
  },
  {
   "t0": 14.205,
   "t1": 16.635,
   "text": "Tonight, it reverses.",
   "line": "L2",
   "spoken": "Tonight, it reverses."
  },
  {
   "t0": 16.655,
   "t1": 19.97,
   "text": "A thought experiment, built from real physics.",
   "line": "L2",
   "spoken": "A thought experiment, built from real physics."
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.27,
   "t1": 21.49,
   "text": "Watch the number.",
   "line": "L3",
   "spoken": "Watch the number."
  },
  {
   "t0": 21.51,
   "t1": 23.52,
   "text": "It only goes down.",
   "line": "L3",
   "spoken": "It only goes down."
  },
  {
   "t0": 30.025,
   "t1": 32.445,
   "text": "179,000.",
   "line": "L4",
   "spoken": "One hundred seventy-nine thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 32.465,
   "t1": 33.68,
   "text": "A third wider.",
   "line": "L4",
   "spoken": "A third wider."
  },
  {
   "t0": 37.01,
   "t1": 41.27,
   "text": "And the sea already feels it: more than twice the tidal pull.",
   "line": "L4",
   "spoken": "And the sea already feels it: more than twice the tidal pull."
  },
  {
   "t0": 45.09,
   "t1": 49.82,
   "text": "Halve the distance, and the water starts to climb.",
   "line": "L5",
   "spoken": "Halve the distance, and the water starts to climb."
  },
  {
   "t0": 56.34,
   "t1": 58.21,
   "text": "Half the distance.",
   "line": "L6",
   "spoken": "Half the distance."
  },
  {
   "t0": 58.23,
   "t1": 60.15,
   "text": "Twice as wide.",
   "line": "L6",
   "spoken": "Twice as wide."
  },
  {
   "t0": 60.26,
   "t1": 61.97,
   "text": "8× the tidal pull.",
   "line": "L6",
   "spoken": "Eight times the tidal pull."
  },
  {
   "t0": 73.785,
   "t1": 74.8,
   "text": "Not a measured height.",
   "line": "L7",
   "spoken": "Not a measured height."
  },
  {
   "t0": 79.885,
   "t1": 85.25,
   "text": "Just the idea: the whole ocean, lifted from above.",
   "line": "L7",
   "spoken": "Just the idea: the whole ocean, lifted from above."
  },
  {
   "t0": 91.76,
   "t1": 94.96,
   "text": "And the night is about to change.",
   "line": "L8",
   "spoken": "And the night is about to change."
  },
  {
   "t0": 102.87,
   "t1": 102.91,
   "text": "93,000.",
   "line": "L9",
   "spoken": "Ninety-three thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 102.93,
   "t1": 107.25,
   "text": "6.5× the moonlight.",
   "line": "L9",
   "spoken": "Six and a half times the moonlight."
  },
  {
   "t0": 114.645,
   "t1": 117.38,
   "text": "Your shadow is sharp on the sand.",
   "line": "L9",
   "spoken": "Your shadow is sharp on the sand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 124.6,
   "t1": 126.395,
   "text": "And it's faster.",
   "line": "L10",
   "spoken": "And it's faster."
  },
  {
   "t0": 130.56,
   "t1": 134.29,
   "text": "One lap takes about 7 days, not 27.",
   "line": "L10",
   "spoken": "One lap takes about seven days, not twenty-seven."
  },
  {
   "t0": 143.065,
   "t1": 144.77,
   "text": "It's bigger than the Sun now.",
   "line": "L11",
   "spoken": "It's bigger than the Sun now."
  },
  {
   "t0": 150.56,
   "t1": 152.94,
   "text": "So what happens when they line up?",
   "line": "L11",
   "spoken": "So what happens when they line up?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 160.385,
   "t1": 162.105,
   "text": "62,000.",
   "line": "L12",
   "spoken": "Sixty-two thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 162.125,
   "t1": 163.995,
   "text": "Nearly 4× wider.",
   "line": "L12",
   "spoken": "Nearly four times wider."
  },
  {
   "t0": 169.41,
   "t1": 173.835,
   "text": "Its shadow on Earth is wider, and eclipses come far more often.",
   "line": "L12",
   "spoken": "Its shadow on Earth is wider, and eclipses come far more often."
  },
  {
   "t0": 181.185,
   "t1": 184.145,
   "text": "Not every month, because the orbit is tilted.",
   "line": "L12",
   "spoken": "Not every month, because the orbit is tilted."
  },
  {
   "t0": 189.425,
   "t1": 190.41,
   "text": "But often.",
   "line": "L12",
   "spoken": "But often."
  },
  {
   "t0": 197.8,
   "t1": 200.97,
   "text": "If that made the sky feel bigger, tap like and subscribe.",
   "line": "D2",
   "spoken": "If that made the sky feel bigger, tap like and subscribe."
  },
  {
   "t0": 201.775,
   "t1": 202.905,
   "text": "Closer.",
   "line": "L13",
   "spoken": "Closer."
  },
  {
   "t0": 202.925,
   "t1": 203.99,
   "text": "Faster.",
   "line": "L13",
   "spoken": "Faster."
  },
  {
   "t0": 208.32,
   "t1": 210.61,
   "text": "And the ground feels it too.",
   "line": "L13",
   "spoken": "And the ground feels it too."
  },
  {
   "t0": 218.625,
   "t1": 220.185,
   "text": "43,000.",
   "line": "L14",
   "spoken": "Forty-three thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 225.575,
   "t1": 229.035,
   "text": "More than 160× today's tidal pull.",
   "line": "L14",
   "spoken": "More than a hundred sixty times today's tidal pull."
  },
  {
   "t0": 236.365,
   "t1": 240.935,
   "text": "The solid ground already rises and falls about a foot a day.",
   "line": "L14",
   "spoken": "The solid ground already rises and falls about a foot a day."
  },
  {
   "t0": 249.53,
   "t1": 251.905,
   "text": "Here, it would flex far more.",
   "line": "L14",
   "spoken": "Here, it would flex far more."
  },
  {
   "t0": 260.45,
   "t1": 264.765,
   "text": "Soon, the Moon rises on the wrong side of the sky.",
   "line": "L15",
   "spoken": "Soon, the Moon rises on the wrong side of the sky."
  },
  {
   "t0": 272.36,
   "t1": 274.01,
   "text": "31,000.",
   "line": "L16",
   "spoken": "Thirty-one thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 274.03,
   "t1": 275.8,
   "text": "Nearly 8× wider.",
   "line": "L16",
   "spoken": "Nearly eight times wider."
  },
  {
   "t0": 280.18,
   "t1": 285.165,
   "text": "One lap takes about a day and a quarter, close to how fast the Earth turns.",
   "line": "L16",
   "spoken": "One lap takes about a day and a quarter, close to how fast the Earth turns."
  },
  {
   "t0": 289.39,
   "t1": 291.08,
   "text": "26,000.",
   "line": "L17",
   "spoken": "Twenty-six thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 291.1,
   "t1": 292.42,
   "text": "It hangs still.",
   "line": "L17",
   "spoken": "It hangs still."
  },
  {
   "t0": 299.115,
   "t1": 300.725,
   "text": "Then it slides the wrong way.",
   "line": "L18",
   "spoken": "Then it slides the wrong way."
  },
  {
   "t0": 309.97,
   "t1": 311.83,
   "text": "It rises in the west.",
   "line": "L18",
   "spoken": "It rises in the west."
  },
  {
   "t0": 325.12,
   "t1": 325.16,
   "text": "19,000.",
   "line": "L19",
   "spoken": "Nineteen thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 325.18,
   "t1": 325.19,
   "text": "16.",
   "line": "L19",
   "spoken": "Sixteen."
  },
  {
   "t0": 325.21,
   "t1": 325.65,
   "text": "12.",
   "line": "L19",
   "spoken": "Twelve."
  },
  {
   "t0": 337.89,
   "t1": 341.68,
   "text": "Around 11,000 miles is the Roche limit: where Earth's tides",
   "line": "L20",
   "spoken": "Around eleven thousand miles is the Roche limit: where Earth's tides pull harder than the Moon's own gravity holds it together."
  },
  {
   "t0": 341.7,
   "t1": 345.84,
   "text": "pull harder than the Moon's own gravity holds it together.",
   "line": "L20",
   "spoken": "Around eleven thousand miles is the Roche limit: where Earth's tides pull harder than the Moon's own gravity holds it together."
  },
  {
   "t0": 345.86,
   "t1": 348.285,
   "text": "That's if the Moon acts like a fluid.",
   "line": "L20",
   "spoken": "That's if the Moon acts like a fluid."
  },
  {
   "t0": 348.305,
   "t1": 351.22,
   "text": "A perfectly rigid Moon could come to about 6,000.",
   "line": "L20",
   "spoken": "A perfectly rigid Moon could come to about six thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 356.85,
   "t1": 360.98,
   "text": "At 11,000, it's more than 20× wider than tonight.",
   "line": "L21",
   "spoken": "At eleven thousand, it's more than twenty times wider than tonight."
  },
  {
   "t0": 361.0,
   "t1": 363.333,
   "text": "A wall of grey, straining.",
   "line": "L21",
   "spoken": "A wall of grey, straining."
  },
  {
   "t0": 370.738,
   "t1": 373.188,
   "text": "And then it does something no Moon should survive.",
   "line": "L22",
   "spoken": "And then it does something no Moon should survive."
  },
  {
   "t0": 373.713,
   "t1": 374.858,
   "text": "It comes apart.",
   "line": "L23",
   "spoken": "It comes apart."
  },
  {
   "t0": 374.878,
   "t1": 376.158,
   "text": "Not an explosion.",
   "line": "L23",
   "spoken": "Not an explosion."
  },
  {
   "t0": 376.178,
   "t1": 377.368,
   "text": "A stretch.",
   "line": "L23",
   "spoken": "A stretch."
  },
  {
   "t0": 387.863,
   "t1": 393.308,
   "text": "The rock spreads along its old orbit, and over time it can flatten into a ring.",
   "line": "L24",
   "spoken": "The rock spreads along its old orbit, and over time it can flatten into a ring."
  },
  {
   "t0": 402.878,
   "t1": 403.683,
   "text": "No Moon.",
   "line": "L25",
   "spoken": "No Moon."
  },
  {
